		position: relative;
		overflow-x: hidden;
		background: var(--ds-bg-gradient);
		color: var(--ds-text-primary);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	/* Background Scene: Skewed Rays & Noise Overlay */
	.ds-bg-viewport {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.ds-bg-rays {
		position: absolute;
		inset: -20%;
